      <span class="tw-section-label">Why Twish</span>
      <h2>What makes this place <em style="color:var(--tw-gold);">different</em></h2>
      <hr class="tw-divider">
      <p style="max-width:580px;margin:1.25rem auto 0;">There is no shortage of therapists in the GTA. Here is why people choose Twish specifically and why they stay.</p>
