      <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-3 tw-fade tw-fade-delay-1"><div class="tw-approach-card tw-card-static h-100"><div style="font-size:2rem;margin-bottom:1rem;"><i class="bi bi-globe2" style="color:var(--tw-gold);"></i></div><h4>Culturally Informed</h4><p>Shimul understands the weight of cultural expectations, intergenerational dynamics, immigration stress, and the tension between identity and belonging. Your cultural context is never left at the door. It is part of the work.</p></div></div>
      <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-3 tw-fade tw-fade-delay-2"><div class="tw-approach-card tw-card-static h-100"><div style="font-size:2rem;margin-bottom:1rem;"><i class="bi bi-award" style="color:var(--tw-gold);"></i></div><h4>Fully Regulated</h4><p>Registered Psychotherapist (Qualifying) with CRPO Registration 18680 and an active CCPA member. Professional, ethically governed care backed by formal clinical training and ongoing regulatory accountability.</p></div></div>
      <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-3 tw-fade tw-fade-delay-3"><div class="tw-approach-card tw-card-static h-100"><div style="font-size:2rem;margin-bottom:1rem;"><i class="bi bi-geo-alt" style="color:var(--tw-gold);"></i></div><h4>Three Locations</h4><p>In-person in Mississauga at 365 Prince of Wales Dr, Markham at 10 Villa Ada Drive, 4300 Upper Middle Rd Unit 3, Burlington, ON, plus virtual therapy anywhere in Canada. Accessible care across the GTA and beyond.</p></div></div>
